<title>UK: Sachsen LB adds 500 million marks to five-year bon.</title>
<headline>Sachsen LB adds 500 million marks to five-year bon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Commerzbank and CDC said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SACHSEN LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    28.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     LISTING    FFT	 SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  19 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED OVER SERIES 122 OBL</p>
<p>		ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED 06.MAR</p>
<p> NOTES	OEEFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 86</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
